# LiquidFun-style 2D particles in Blender

Compact 2D PBF + optional elastic springs for Geometry Nodes **LiquidFun Solver**.

- Spirit of Google LiquidFun (Box2D + particles). Independent of vendored Box2D 3.x.
- Not a git-subtree of https://github.com/google/liquidfun (old Box2D 2.3 fork).
- License: MIT (see LICENSE)
